8
00:00:23,017 --> 00:00:25,617
Similar parts can belong
to different jobs.

9
00:00:26,277 --> 00:00:30,037
The conversation checks the work
order, invoice, part, and purchase

10
00:00:30,037 --> 00:00:32,537
line before the operator
