11
00:00:34,237 --> 00:00:36,537
I found two matches
for that part number.

12
00:00:36,617 --> 00:00:41,537
Is this for invoice
INV-8042 on job WO-418

13
00:00:41,537 --> 00:00:46,297
or invoice INV-7901 on job WO-397?

14
00:00:47,177 --> 00:00:49,357
I have recorded those details.

15
00:00:49,617 --> 00:00:50,677
For Northline Parts,

16
00:00:50,816 --> 00:00:54,117
the core must be dispatched
by September 21st, 2026,

17
00:00:54,217 --> 00:00:56,397
